{"id":"de_sespe_re_ment","lemma":"désespérément","pos":"adv","rank":4640,"glosses":["desperately"],"ipa":"/de.zɛs.pe.ʁe.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/98/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-d%C3%A9sesp%C3%A9r%C3%A9ment.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-d%C3%A9sesp%C3%A9r%C3%A9ment.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"J'ai désespérément besoin d'aide.","en":"I'm in desperate need of help.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"need"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"help, support"}]},{"text":"Il voulait désespérément s'échapper.","en":"He was desperate to escape.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},null,{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"to escape , evade"}]},{"text":"Il est désespérément amoureux.","en":"He's hopelessly in love.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"in love"}]},{"text":"J'avais désespérément besoin de cet argent.","en":"I needed the money desperately.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"need"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"this"},{"g":"money"}]},{"text":"On a désespérément besoin de bénévoles.","en":"Volunteers are desperately needed.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"need"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"voluntary, unpaid","l":"bénévole"}]}]}